Package: dedaptive
Type: Package
Title: R package for DEcision-oriented aDAPTIVE (dedaptive) testing
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Patric", "Wyss",
      email = "patric.wyss@fhnw.ch",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    ),
    person(
      "Markus", "Steiner",
      email = "markus.steiner@fhnw.ch",
      role = "ctb"
    )
  )
Description: Implements DEcision-oriented aDAPTIVE (dedaptive) testing. Items are
    selected sequentially to minimize the expected costs of misclassification
    for one or more binary decisions (e.g., thresholds on sum scores) plus a
    cost per administered item. Predictions are based on multidimensional item
    response theory models (via 'mirt') or latent class models (via 'poLCA'),
    optionally with a latent regression on covariates.
